OL,3,GNEWSAWestside Cowboy named BBC
OL,4,AIntroducing Artist of the Year 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestside Cowboy have been announced as
OL,7,FBBC Introducing Artist of the Year 2026
OL,8,Ffollowing in the talented footsteps of
OL,9,Fhousehold names including Olivia Dean,
OL,10,FMyles Smith and Tom Grennan.
OL,12,FThe four-piece Manchester band -
OL,13,Fcomprising of Jimmy Bradbury, Reuben
OL,14,FHaycocks, Aoife Anson O'Connell and
OL,15,FPaddy Murphy - have rocketed from the
OL,16,Fstudent pub circuit to starring at some
OL,17,Fof the UK's biggest festivals in two
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
